)"><div class="space-y-4"><div class="[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><h2 class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-[28px] md:text-[36px] leading-[1.1] -tracking-[0.02em] font-normal mb-6 mt-24 max-w-[400px]">High-density power delivery</h2><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap text-[16px] md:text-[16px] leading-[1.5] font-medium mb-4 max-w-[400px]">With power delivery just 0.5 millimeters away from the processor - roughly 100x closer than the roughly 50mm of conventional GPU boards - CS-4 nearly eliminates board-level power loss. This enables the delivery of twice as much power to the WSE-3T, enabling higher operating frequencies and faster token generation.​</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative self-start opacity-0 bg-background overflow-hidden rounded-lg to-md:order-1 h-full w-full col-span-2 md:col-span-4" style="transform-style:preserve-3d;transform-origin:top;will-change:transform, opacity;backface-visibility:hidden;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;aspect-ratio:auto"><div class="px-pad py-5 md:p-pad w-full"><img alt="" loading="lazy" class="block max-w-full w-full h-auto rounded-[5px] overflow-hidden" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" placeholder="empty" srcSet="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/e4qjo92p/production/41dfa7c54517453771770b8510f881239e497c2b-3124x1960.png?auto=format&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=max&amp;q=75&amp;w=250 250w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/e4qjo92p/production/41dfa7c54517453771770b8510f881239e497c2b-3124x1960.png?auto=format&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=max&amp;q=75&amp;w=500 500w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/e4qjo92p/production/41dfa7c54517453771770b8510f881239e497c2b-3124x1960.png?auto=format&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=max&amp;q=75&amp;w=750 750w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/e4qjo92p/production/41dfa7c54517453771770b8510f881239e497c2b-3124x1960.png?auto=format&amp;dpr=2&amp;fit=max&amp;q=75&amp;w=1000 1000w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/e4qjo92p/production/41dfa7c54517453771770b8510f881239e497c2b-3124x1960.png?auto=format&amp;dpr=2&amp;f